*   **Data-Hypothesis Alignment**: The dataset is explicitly generated from a known four-factor linear model. Clustering based on return correlations will inherently recover the factor loadings (betas) because the covariance matrix is dominated by these four factors. This is a tautology, not a discovery of "hidden sub-sector dependencies."
